<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa caterer takes 51 pct in Swedish firm.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa caterer takes 51 pct in Swedish firm.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG's LSG Lufthansa Service/Sky Chefs unit, one of the world's largest in-flight catering groups, said on Thursday it had bought a 51 percent stake in Sweden's Top Flight Catering AB.</p>
<p>LSG said the purchase, for which financial details were not given, was the first step in expansion plans for the Scandinavian market, which it sees as one of Europe's growth markets for air travel.</p>
<p>LSG has annual sales of more than four billion marks and employs some 37,000 staff.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
